! Memory configuration probe -> %g2 (4 bits per logical 64 MB slot). Pass 1 (4x): VCR <- 0x100<<2k,
! if vsimm_id_byte_check(k*64MB)==0 then nibble(4+n) = vsimm_probe_slot(k*64MB). Pass 2 (8 slots):
! skip slots whose nibble&0xb!=0; for slots 4-7 skip if the VSIMM control space 0x9x000000 byte is an
! ID (f1/f2/f3/fd); else nibble(slot) = dsimm_size_slot(slot*64MB) (6=64MB, 4=16MB, 2=4MB, 0=none).
! Finally EFSR <- 0.

