! obp_cache_init: Viking (MCNTL.IMPL 0): flash-clear I and D caches (ASI 0x36/
! 0x37 va 0 and 0x80000000), clear I-cache tags (ASI 0x0c, 0x40000000 +
! n*0x40), D-cache tags (ASI 0x0e), store-buffer tags (ASI 0x30 va 0..0x38)
! and control (ASI 0x32). With MXCC (MCNTL.MB 0): MXCC error reg = all ones
! (write-1-to-clear), clear 0x2000 E-cache tags (ASI 2 0x01800000 + n<<7),
! MXCC control 0x01c00a04 = 0x38, MCNTL |= 0x11000 (PE|TC). All: MCNTL |=
! 0x4000 (SE, snoop), ASI 0x4c (ACTION) = 0. Ross (IMPL != 0) with MCNTL bit
! 27 set (605): flush context/user (ASI 0x13/0x14), clear tags, MCNTL |= 0x100.
! Otherwise (HyperSPARC): flush the I-cache (ASI 0x31), %asr31 = 1, size the
! cache with ASI 0x0f/0x0e writes, MCNTL |= 0x380500 (+0x1000 if the probe
! aliases); returns the size code.

